# Session mode NOLNEG across a LOAD (PLAN_CONSOLIDATION 3.3 rule-6 audit, 2026-10-11).
# NOLNEG works with or without a deck, but every LOAD resets ifLNegOK (the LOAD handler also sets .TRUE.) to its start-up value
# (macos_mod_init_vars, run by reinitialise_variables), with no message.  The ruling is Dave's
# (PLAN section 4): TODAY's behaviour is pinned below; for the ruled outcome swap the active
# EXPECT for the 'OUTCOME (a)' line (state survives the load).  STATUS prints the flag
# (extended 2026-10-11).
old $ROOT/ZGD_test_files/tst_calib_spot4.in
nolneg
status
old $ROOT/ZGD_test_files/tst_calib_spot4.in
status
